{
  "name": "l0_save_restore_blocks",
  "about": "The save/restore block framework CServerGameDLL runs a map's save and restore through (L0-r029): slot 17 PreSave 0x1011b890 (a tail jump into CSaveRestoreBlockSet slot 1 0x101a4850: N := the handler count, each record named by Q_strncpy, each handler's PreSave), slot 18 Save 0x1011b080 (set slot 2 0x101a48e0: locBody := Tell-t0 per block, the handler's Save, +0x3c := the data length; returns 1 on every path), slot 19 0x1011b8b0 (set slot 3 0x101a4970: two 0xFFFFFFFF placeholders, a 0xFF-filled temp directory, locHeader := Tell-t0 per block before the handler's WriteSaveHeaders, +0x38 := the header length, Seek(t0) and the in-place rewrite of the two lengths and the real directory, Seek(end); then set slot 4 0x101a4bf0: every PostSave, then the directory purge), slot 20 0x1011b950 (set slot 5 0x101a4c70 every PreRestore; set slot 6 0x101a4cb0: the two lengths, the directory, per registered handler a strcmp lookup among the N records -- found and locHeader != -1: Seek(t0+locHeader) and ReadRestoreHeaders, else a silent skip -- then Seek(t0 + +0x38)), slot 21 Restore 0x1011b300 (set slot 7 0x101a4e70: the same lookup on locBody, Seek(t0+locBody), the handler's Restore(adapter, p2, p3) with the engine's two dwords forwarded unchanged, then Seek(t0 + +0x3c); set slot 8 0x101a4fa0: every PostRestore, then the purge), in the engine's order (vfunc13 0x20096470: 17, 18, test, 19; vfunc9 0x200975f0: 20, 21; a level transition vfunc10 0x20097d00: 20 only, no purge). Set slots 9 0x101a5020 / 10 0x101a5100 register and remove handlers (DLLInit 0x1011a0c0 appends retail's five: Entities, EventQueue, Physics, AI, Python -- the three-block fixtures here stand in for them). Offsets are the port's: a record is its 0x28 raw bytes and a handler writes dwords (decisions.md D6, the byte encoding is a named modernization); the sequence, the offsets' relations and the cursor postconditions are retail's. Reported as fail when a phase runs out of order, a block is dispatched that the directory does not name, a -1 offset is not skipped, or a cursor ends elsewhere.",
  "stage": "arena",
  "seed": 1,
  "duration": 4.5,
