  "notes": "Layout: X body 3 dwords at rel 0, Y body 0 at 12, Z body 2 at 12, data length 20; header section at 20: 2 placeholders (8) + N (4) + 3 x 0x28 (120) = 132, then X header 1 dword at 132, Y 2 dwords at 136, Z 0 at 144, header length 144, end 164. The buffer is pinned at 4096 so every Seek lands as it does in the engine's own allocation. The `patched` fixture's directory is edited before its restore (Z locHeader -1, Y locBody -1) for the two skip arms. A level transition leaves N=3 (no slot 8 purge); a restore ends at N=0."
